&_nc_ohc=lmL353dfiPYQ7kNvwGbcAuK&_nc_oc=AdpQHRe7SCVA-gwx_aBo_0PhL_peCR-uwfr3RPUpBa3PDs4RtK5U8HREjRYruvlHQWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIY3SdXn8aBvMlNYrmsKXgeAxEB2BWvNaAOsJSwWYxCg&oe=6AF0A743"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d9aP3UvaFCAQ7kNvwHm0HCM&_nc_oc=Adoq-phOvliaEZDO-JLvcZmA-vG24BQKjtLUlXiQZ2fHX1yWNQrxIMYWZeYdIubeWfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTs20u7u5GJuFLfC4DGNPqr7JFRHNIO-856j7nJJH5d_g&oe=6AF09DCB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lccTSS9gfjEQ7kNvwGw6Ig8&_nc_oc=Ado9y2ntFlgOlGXLGk_7VAbIaUZI0A5HegTrnRzCgIV8gva5VOtImaFp2Mn9DNA97Ec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBxT80l0iTMHXaWtQwCoYwDCLJTG4HsBprT4uv5HIHag&oe=6AF0B481"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rozggy68LJ4Q7kNvwFGl2H0&_nc_oc=Adowy6H-shKwj8ofxOQIACEkszZNgWewvN1JBulXVpsNH7de-EC2tNaTAZWN65qoFY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_N24fiKkzkN92_V44cyFcZ1HXL7TAFxHFVJMOBjrmAA&oe=6AF09584"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r4lTcKE8JqUQ7kNvwH1mmRi&_nc_oc=AdovMHM2JqC5GELfEX21l8AgusdhAYwNFaGAKS22AjxWfUzmAuRZ0WyJSV1CXhJSP_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQP0s7ajD5g44KAwnVObTszz1xQjxxU2AM7Plh-7LI2vg&oe=6AF08941"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8FnUMKTDHW8Q7kNvwGyE3Q6&_nc_oc=AdrS-JEO3hV63gIYSAiLo3SW2i2yM_vqFc4TuZ5GEXfGS-YgAWeFcl_bYtkOwQ8UAck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2C3eSUOXTAWSkkfR6e9ZVbz0yvVAsDpVL9DvGbbZdvw&oe=6AF07DE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jM5OMZu_OYUQ7kNvwFXQTgb&_nc_oc=AdowoG229_GpGg2D8UxVK1Kz9Ilgx_vcm_VmtVrDZCVWABVUwoxcihRNVdM_grirXEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTE7Fnh4PJGbzZDM3kN2od7SYSZWwlknA3DOhjbk0wi5A&oe=6AF08424"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oSPJ0Py9mLUQ7kNvwFxQrIZ&_nc_oc=AdpEg6DzAfkactcYSUqrwxs6mMiGREOc_qlqIp5NX1DXxskKjfBxm1hX9kWTKaUuBQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQr7GwTyHcot08GWDPcLxUW4eQGZConZUbnAWvOabq3HA&oe=6AF086FC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3KMoy9cOeQQ7kNvwGjVFAT&_nc_oc=Adr14b6uyaj1yHm1atSHpjaJU0isxk892BQVGfsZZyK14EpYIwh6dVyWh2JZj-U-TYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQkETmls9VdpmLYl_h7sYk0AEcQwpjE33vhIQFzj_bviQ&oe=6AF0AA2E"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MZKjzkidaf4Q7kNvwGOlhXv&_nc_oc=AdqxLG0qKEe_MwXr1GsGr-1GhkgwmTR8AiWixgQSwxpCl-DRm_HkFk4k-jN8sMrtpSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRin9sWW0EnYLtR3-kvQJdPRfkzfdmi0B7j-eqDmZevIA&oe=6AF0A3C9"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cdhyJKkpZY0Q7kNvwEb6_e7&_nc_oc=AdqxWS3lZnQ9qDQzlmE49pw78XlpKe1iic4asplsrFEetsdmmz3P_PNch28gHFzXztU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDHp_HlJda5hi3nBl3dl2hbdwfaAP71XNHtcSsISgIBw&oe=6AF0B396"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pa1Y2MAVhcwQ7kNvwELHNd7&_nc_oc=Adp1dRtnR-hSm6KryTpz_lDf-R49vq0SKfXHYBRC1x7gMzfd4zoumK81KqyjM2V1dK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQO-XiJUJxlU45JqnhoWyQpRZc7oHzgf8wts6_KS4DU2Q&oe=6AF09F32"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nq39ZQVBtacQ7kNvwGMM2Sh&_nc_oc=AdqNpSR0k262aihK6sv7kqtjI1ZDGMAogroie_9wE1Ag7d-QYZndDA1sYjTyPR2IHAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKpdyW4PRgMT6IK6Nw6tPWZwsSNwijnIryXDHyRNpJng&oe=6AF093E6"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=flevGJxsTHwQ7kNvwHJdRjv&_nc_oc=AdqaSlvfyi_YuSiztPM_SZQW94c-WQILUaEVmhP7u1B_h7RleTrJ5kdrwjuc6ES1WtQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRamqLJF98krtIULqvU1svancdoL8pliH0rbMOK3b3zhg&oe=6AF097A3"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=faQEBVQgi8QQ7kNvwHSGWwB&_nc_oc=AdoeMAi2rfdAid-MojsPOHZQDuUUP5qTGCK-Ec9ln4VL1TV4mUchDbjL99mEl0_4OT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSz1n4bsIO0aISp9_itjrVnf-SicshB9q-pKS7HDka_-w&oe=6AF07FA3"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=byRd3kIWugcQ7kNvwFKT3Jq&_nc_oc=AdoC3WVXHPlTi9ar7Fcaafek-iD2lGHxIyM31fL6_m76GrUf8hUt--ulxCHcFYka-RI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRLtlFQRWOqRLHnB-VXDSA01sQ5H2bIVBTNCj2y31JEGw&oe=6AF07EF8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g